# SquirrelJME and FreeJ2ME-Plus can share saves

In cooperation with the developer of FreeJ2ME-Plus, a derivation of
SquirrelJME's existing save format was created which now both emulators
implement which means that saves are sharable between the two emulators!

The format consists of a JSON metadata file along with basic binaries of
record data, so it is very simple and easy to implement.

A specification is available
at <https://squirreljme.cc/doc/trunk/assets/doc/specification-squirreljme-rms.mkd>.
